    "136.title" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"NSTextFieldCell\"; title = \"Updating as often as possible will produce the most responsive VNC session at the expense of heavy CPU usage and lots of network activity.  Only updating manually uses minimal CPU and produces minimal network activity, but the session is only refreshed when you explicitly request it using the \\\"Refresh Window\\\" command.\"; ObjectID = \"136\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Updating as often as possible will produce the most responsive VNC session at the expense of heavy CPU usage and lots of network activity.  Only updating manually uses minimal CPU and produces minimal network activity, but the session is only refreshed when you explicitly request it using the \"Refresh Window\" command."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rafraîchir aussi souvent que possible offrira la session la plus réactive, mais en consommant beaucoup de ressources processeur et en augmentant le trafic réseau. Rafraîchir manuellement uniquement consommera le moins de ressources processeur et produira le moins de trafic réseau, mais la session ne sera rafraîchie qu’en appelant explicitement la commande « Rafraîchir » du menu « Fenêtre »  "
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiornando il più possibile produrrà una risposta veloce nella sessione VNC ma impegna il processore ed il traffico internet.  Solo se il refresh viene aggiornato manualmente (usando poi \"Aggiorna Finestra\") ci sarà un uso minimo del processore e più libertà nel scaricare e/o inviare dati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"できる限り頻繁に更新する\" ともっともレスポンスがよくなりますが、CPU やネットワークに高い負荷をかけます。\"手動で更新する\"と負荷を最小限に抑えることができますが、\"再描画\" コマンドを使用しないと画面が更新されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
